{{/*
  The payment-status poll's answer, and the page it belongs to. A QR hand-over has
  no browser redirect back — the registrant pays in an app, often on another
  device — so the hand-over page asks this every few seconds. The block is what
  htmx swaps; the page around it is what somebody opening the URL directly gets.
*/}}
{{define "content"}}
<h1>Payment status</h1>
<div id="payment-status">{{template "checkout_status_block" .}}</div>
{{end}}

{{/* The htmx half: the block alone, renderable by name. */}}
{{define "checkout_status_fragment"}}{{template "checkout_status_block" .}}{{end}}
